      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/aeb1de/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-12-04T18:54:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I am about to start a campaign based on the starter pack and two free adventures already released. My question is does anyone have any reasonable time frame for the book to be released to the general public?</p>\n<p>I see that the game has missed a lot of release time frames over the years, so it makes me nervous starting a campaign for a game that has yet to have its full rules released.</p>\n<p>should i hold off till release? should I just use another system? or am i worrying for no reason and the game will be released soon?</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:54:30.281Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
