      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/bc8723/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-12-04T23:44:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I second what Sea-Envy said, you should be able to get it by late January. Printing is done and GTG are starting to get shipments and theyll be shipping those out over the next couple of weeks to KS backers.</p>\n<p>Depending on what your campaign is like, I'd reccomend waiting since we're at the home stretch. That way you'll have the full rules of character creation and moderating the game. Personally character creation is what gets me jazzed to see what my players come up with and adapt my campaign accordingly.</p>",
